            "name": "Commit-0",
            "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"dz\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Bilingual Dictionary</title>\n    <link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"manifest.json\">\n    <meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#8B0000\">\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div id=\"appSplash\" class=\"splash-overlay\">\n        <div class=\"splash-card\">\n            <img src=\"assets/app-logo.png\" alt=\"Bilingual Dictionary Logo\" class=\"splash-logo\">\n            <p class=\"welcome-greeting uchen-word\" style=\"font-size: 2.2rem; margin-bottom: 5px;\">སྐུ་གཟུགས་བཟང་པོ་ལགས།</p>\n            <h1 class=\"splash-title\">Bilingual Dictionary</h1>\n            <p class=\"splash-description\">A simple bilingual dictionary for personal use, built to support Dzongkha readers, translators, language officers, and learners.</p>\n            \n            <div class=\"welcome-stats\" style=\"margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; width: 100%;\">\n                <div>\n                    <strong id=\"splashDzEnCount\">36,499</strong>\n                    <span>Dzongkha-English</span>\n                </div>\n                <div>\n                    <strong id=\"splashEnDzCount\">31,538</strong>\n                    <span>English-Dzongkha</span>\n                </div>\n                <div>\n                    <strong id=\"splashDzDzCount\">20,622</strong>\n                    <span>Dzongkha definitions</span>\n                </div>\n                <div>\n                    <strong id=\"splashTensesCount\">0</strong>\n                    <span>Tenses</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"splash-actions\">\n                <button id=\"splashStartBtn\" class=\"primary-button\" type=\"button\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\n                    <svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m20.5 19.1-4.6-4.6a7 7 0 1 0-1.4 1.4l4.6 4.6 1.4-1.4ZM5 10.5a5.5 5.5 0 1 1 11 0 5.5 5.5 0 0 1-11 0Z\"/></svg>\n                    <span>Start searching</span>\n                </button>\n                <button id=\"splashThemeBtn\" class=\"secondary-button\" type=\"button\">Switch theme</button>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <main class=\"app-shell\">\n        <aside class=\"side-nav\" aria-label=\"App navigation\">\n            <div class=\"side-brand\">\n                <img src=\"assets/app-logo.png\" alt=\"Bilingual Dictionary logo\">\n                <div>\n                    <span>Bilingual</span>\n                    <strong>Dictionary</strong>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <nav class=\"app-nav\">\n                <button class=\"nav-link active\" type=\"button\" data-view=\"home\" aria-label=\"Home\">\n                    <svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 10.8 12 3l9 7.8V21h-6v-6H9v6H3V10.8Z\"/></svg>\n                    <span>Home</span>\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"nav-link\" type=\"button\" data-view=\"search\" aria-label=\"Search\">\n                    <svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m20.5 19.1-4.6-4.6a7 7 0 1 0-1.4 1.4l4.6 4.6 1.4-1.4ZM5 10.5a5.5 5.5 0 1 1 11 0 5.5 5.5 0 0 1-11 0Z\"/></svg>\n                    <span>Search</span>\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"nav-link\" type=\"button\" data-view=\"favorites\" aria-label=\"Favourites\">\n                    <svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m12 3 2.8 5.8 6.4.9-4.6 4.5 1.1 6.3L12 17.5l-5.7 3 1.1-6.3-4.6-4.5 6.4-.9L12 3Z\"/></svg>\n                    <span>Favourites</span>\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"nav-link\" type=\"button\" data-view=\"history\" aria-label=\"History\">\n                    <svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3a9 9 0 1 1-8.7 11.3h2.1A7 7 0 1 0 7 7.1V10H3V3h2v2.5A9 9 0 0 1 12 3Zm1 4v5.2l4 2.4-1 1.7-5-3V7h2Z\"/></svg>\n                    <span>History</span>\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"nav-link\" type=\"button\" data-view=\"notification\" aria-label=\"Notification\">\n                    <svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M18 16v-5a6 6 0 1 0-12 0v5l-2 2v1h16v-1l-2-2Zm-8 5h4a2 2 0 0 1-4 0Z\"/></svg>\n                    <span>Notice</span>\n                    <span id=\"notifBadge\" class=\"notif-badge\" hidden>0</span>\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"nav-link\" type=\"button\" data-view=\"creator\" aria-label=\"Creator\">\n                    <svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 12a4.5 4.5 0 1 0 0-9 4.5 4.5 0 0 0 0 9Zm0 2c-4.7 0-8 2.6-8 6v1h16v-1c0-3.4-3.3-6-8-6Z\"/></svg>\n                    <span>Creator</span>\n                </button>\n            </nav>\n\n            <div class=\"side-note\">\n                <span class=\"uchen-word\">རྫོང་ཁ།</span>\n                <p>Preserving language, identity, and cultural knowledge.</p>\n            </div>\n        </aside>\n\n        <section class=\"app-main\">\n            <div id=\"notificationBar\" class=\"notification-bar\" hidden></div>\n\n            <header class=\"app-topbar\">\n                <div class=\"topbar-title\">\n                    <p class=\"eyebrow\">Personal Language Tool</p>\n                    <h1>Bilingual Dictionary</h1>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"header-actions\">\n                    <button id=\"themeToggle\" class=\"icon-button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" type=\"button\" title=\"Switch theme\">\n                        <svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3a9 9 0 1 0 9 9 7 7 0 0 1-9-9Z\"/></svg>\n                        <span data-theme-label>Dark</span>\n                    </button>\n                    <a href=\"admin.html\" class=\"icon-button\" title=\"Open admin\">\n                        <svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2 4 5v6c0 5 3.4 9.7 8 11 4.6-1.3 8-6 8-11V5l-8-3Zm1 5v5h4v2h-6V7h2Z\"/></svg>\n                        <span>Admin</span>\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n            </header>\n\n            <div class=\"screen-stack\">\n                <section id=\"homeView\" class=\"app-screen is-active\" data-view-panel=\"home\" aria-labelledby=\"homeTitle\">\n                    <div class=\"welcome-interface\">\n                        <div class=\"welcome-content\">\n                            <img class=\"welcome-logo\" src=\"assets/app-logo.png\" alt=\"Bilingual Dictionary logo\">\n                            <p class=\"welcome-greeting uchen-word\">སྐུ་གཟུགས་བཟང་པོ་ལགས།</p>\n                            <h2 id=\"homeTitle\">Bilingual Dictionary</h2>\n                            <p class=\"welcome-copy\">A simple bilingual dictionary for personal use, built to support Dzongkha readers, translators, language officers, and learners.</p>\n                            <div class=\"welcome-actions\">\n                                <button id=\"startLookupButton\" class=\"primary-button\" type=\"button\">\n                                    <svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m20.5 19.1-4.6-4.6a7 7 0 1 0-1.4 1.4l4.6 4.6 1.4-1.4ZM5 10.5a5.5 5.5 0 1 1 11 0 5.5 5.5 0 0 1-11 0Z\"/></svg>\n                                    <span>Start searching</span>\n                                </button>\n                                <button id=\"welcomeThemeButton\" class=\"secondary-button\" type=\"button\">\n                                    <svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3a9 9 0 1 0 9 9 7 7 0 0 1-9-9Z\"/></svg>\n                                    <span>Switch theme</span>\n                                </button>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"welcome-stats\" aria-label=\"Dictionary summary\">\n                                <div>\n                                    <strong id=\"homeDzEnCount\">36,499</strong>\n                                    <span>Dzongkha-English</span>\n                                </div>\n                                <div>\n                                    <strong id=\"homeEnDzCount\">31,538</strong>\n                                    <span>English-Dzongkha</span>\n                                </div>\n                                <div>\n                                    <strong id=\"homeDzDzCount\">20,622</strong>\n                                    <span>Dzongkha definitions</span>\n                                </div>\n                                <div>\n                                    <strong id=\"homeTensesCount\">0</strong>\n                                    <span>Tenses</span>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"welcome-preview\" aria-label=\"Dzongkha importance\">\n                            <div class=\"language-orbit\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                                <span></span>\n                                <span></span>\n                                <span></span>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"preview-word uchen-word\">རྫོང་ཁ།</div>\n                            <div class=\"preview-meaning\">Dzongkha · Bhutan's national language</div>\n                            <p>Dzongkha carries identity, tradition, governance, literature, and everyday communication. This app helps keep that knowledge searchable and useful.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"home-grid\">\n                        <section id=\"wordOfDay\" class=\"word-of-day\" aria-live=\"polite\"></section>\n                        <section class=\"importance-panel\">\n                            <p class=\"section-kicker\">Importance of Dzongkha</p>\n                            <h2>Language is memory in motion.</h2>\n                            <div class=\"importance-list\">\n                                <div><strong>Identity</strong><span>Dzongkha connects people to Bhutanese history, values, and national belonging.</span></div>\n                                <div><strong>Service</strong><span>Clear terminology helps language officers, translators, educators, and readers work with confidence.</span></div>\n                                <div><strong>Continuity</strong><span>Searchable language resources make traditional knowledge easier to preserve and share.</span></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </section>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n\n                <section id=\"searchSection\" class=\"app-screen\" data-view-panel=\"search\" aria-labelledby=\"searchTitle\">\n                    <div class=\"screen-heading\">\n                        <div>\n                            <p class=\"section-kicker\">Lookup</p>\n                            <h2 id=\"searchTitle\">Search dictionary entries</h2>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"search-workspace\">\n                        <section class=\"lookup-panel\" aria-label=\"Dictionary lookup\">\n                            <section class=\"search-panel\">\n                                <label class=\"visually-hidden\" for=\"searchBox\">Search term</label>\n                                <input id=\"searchBox\" autocomplete=\"off\" placeholder=\"Search word in English or Dzongkha\">\n                                <button id=\"searchButton\" type=\"button\">\n                                    <svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m20.5 19.1-4.6-4.6a7 7 0 1 0-1.4 1.4l4.6 4.6 1.4-1.4ZM5 10.5a5.5 5.5 0 1 1 11 0 5.5 5.5 0 0 1-11 0Z\"/></svg>\n                                    <span>Search</span>\n                                </button>\n                            </section>\n\n                            <section id=\"suggestions\" class=\"suggestions\" hidden></section>\n\n                            <div class=\"control-panel\">\n                                <div class=\"direction-toggle\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Search direction\">\n                                    <button type=\"button\" data-direction=\"dz-en\" class=\"active\">Dzongkha → English</button>\n                                    <button type=\"button\" data-direction=\"en-dz\">English → Dzongkha</button>\n                                    <button type=\"button\" data-direction=\"dz-dz\">Dzongkha → Dzongkha</button>\n                                    <button type=\"button\" data-direction=\"tense\">Tenses</button>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </section>\n\n                        <section class=\"results-area\" aria-label=\"Dictionary result\">\n                            <div class=\"results-heading\">\n                                <p class=\"section-kicker\">Result</p>\n                                <span class=\"font-note\">Joyig Dzongkha font enabled</span>\n                            </div>\n                            <section id=\"result\" class=\"result-panel\">\n                                <div class=\"notice\">Search for a word to see its translation and notes.</div>\n                            </section>\n                        </section>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n\n                <section id=\"favoritesSection\" class=\"app-screen\" data-view-panel=\"favorites\" aria-labelledby=\"favoritesTitle\">\n                    <div class=\"screen-heading\">\n                        <div>\n                            <p class=\"section-kicker\">Favourites</p>\n                            <h2 id=\"favoritesTitle\">Saved dictionary words</h2>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <aside id=\"favoritesPanel\" class=\"favorites-panel\"></aside>\n                </section>\n\n                <section id=\"historySection\" class=\"app-screen\" data-view-panel=\"history\" aria-labelledby=\"historyTitle\">\n                    <div class=\"screen-heading\">\n                        <div>\n                            <p class=\"section-kicker\">History</p>\n                            <h2 id=\"historyTitle\">Recent searches</h2>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div id=\"historyPanel\" class=\"history-panel\"></div>\n                </section>\n\n                <section id=\"notificationSection\" class=\"app-screen\" data-view-panel=\"notification\" aria-labelledby=\"notificationTitle\">\n                    <div class=\"screen-heading\">\n                        <div>\n                            <p class=\"section-kicker\">Notification</p>\n                            <h2 id=\"notificationTitle\">Updates and messages</h2>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div id=\"notificationSummary\" class=\"notification-summary\">No new notifications. Admin messages will appear here when posted.</div>\n                </section>\n\n                <section id=\"creatorSection\" class=\"app-screen\" data-view-panel=\"creator\" aria-labelledby=\"creatorTitle\">\n                    <div class=\"creator-section\">\n                        <div class=\"creator-photo-wrap\">\n                            <img class=\"creator-photo\" src=\"assets/jamyang-loday.png\" alt=\"Portrait of Jamyang Loday\">\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"creator-copy\">\n                            <p class=\"section-kicker\">App Creator</p>\n                            <h2 id=\"creatorTitle\">Jamyang Loday</h2>\n                            <p>Jamyang Loday is a Bachelor of Arts graduate from the College of Language and Culture Studies with a specialization in Language and Literature. Presently, he serves as an Assistant Language Development Officer in the Dzongkha Development Division since 2024.</p>\n                            <p>His notable accomplishment includes securing the top position in the RCSE 2023 in the Dzongkha category. In the past, he worked as a Substitute Teacher, gaining valuable experience in education.</p>\n                            <p>Beyond his academic and professional endeavors, Jamyang has skills in graphic design, particularly in designing books, journals, and logos. He also has a keen interest and experience in photography.</p>\n                            <a class=\"contact-link\" href=\"mailto:jamyangl@moha.gov.bt\">\n                                <svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 5h18v14H3V5Zm2 3.2V17h14V8.2l-7 4.7-7-4.7Zm1.2-1.2 5.8 3.9L17.8 7H6.2Z\"/></svg>\n                                <span>jamyangl@moha.gov.bt</span>\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n    </main>\n\n    <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
        }
    ]
}